    "reviews": "\u201cIf you're looking for a short story and a free one that ends on a bit of a surprise, then this is worth checking out.\u201d<br>The Introverted Gamer<br><br>\u201cThere is a special place in my heart for short mysterious VNs that succeed in making you feel vaguely uncomfortable. Guidelicious is exactly that.\u201d<br>User Review<br><br>\u201cShort, intriguing and definitely one of the most uncomfortable visual novel experiences I've ever had, and I mean that in a good way.\u201d<br>User Review<br>",
